<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <PackageId>Ozakboy.TradeKit.Capital</PackageId>
    <AssemblyName>Ozakboy.TradeKit.Capital</AssemblyName>
    <RootNamespace>Ozakboy.TradeKit.Capital</RootNamespace>

    <Title>Ozakboy.TradeKit.Capital — 群益 SKCOM 海外報價、國內期貨 / 選擇權報價與期貨帳務查詢(唯讀)用戶端</Title>
    <Description>群益證券 SKCOM 的 .NET 10 用戶端:海外報價(國際外匯 + 海外期貨)、國內期貨歷史 K 線(0.2.0),以及 0.3.0 的國內期貨 / 選擇權即時報價、海外五檔 / 十檔、海外選擇權報價與期貨帳務查詢(唯讀)。沒有任何下單、刪改單、出入金能力,也不做需要證券戶的功能。SKCOM 是 COM 元件,由隨套件出貨的 x64 宿主行程(建置時複製到 capital-host\)掛載,用戶端以 stdio 換行分隔 JSON 與它溝通;帳密只走子行程環境變數,登入失敗絕不重試,宿主崩潰以退避重啟並重送訂閱,報價主機斷線由宿主退避重連;海外、國內、海外選擇權的狀態各自獨立,任一邊不可用不影響其他邊。價格一律 decimal,時間轉 UTC;帳務記錄有依手冊解析的具名屬性(解析不出為 null)與原始欄位,帳號與戶名不進日誌。以 SKCOM 2.13.59 x64 實測,宿主回報 SKCOM 版本並在版本未實測時記警告。需使用者自行下載並註冊 SKCOM x64。預期失敗一律回 Result,錯誤碼 capital.* 集中在 CapitalErrorCodes。 A .NET 10 client for Capital Securities' SKCOM API: overseas quotes (FX and overseas futures), domestic futures historical K-lines (0.2.0), and in 0.3.0 domestic futures and options live quotes, the overseas best 5 and best 10, overseas option quotes and read-only futures account queries. It cannot place, amend or cancel orders and cannot move funds. An x64 host process shipped in the package loads SKCOM, and the client talks to it over newline-delimited JSON on stdio. Credentials travel only through the child's environment, a failed login is never retried, and a crashed host is restarted with backoff. The overseas, domestic and overseas option sides have separate states. Prices are decimal and times are UTC. Account records carry named properties (null when unreadable) and their raw fields, and account numbers never reach a log. Measured against SKCOM 2.13.59 x64; the host reports the SKCOM version and an unmeasured version logs a warning. Every expected failure is a Result with a capital.* code.</Description>
    <PackageTags>ozakboy;tradekit;capital;skcom;taiwan;taifex;txf;txo;forex;fx;overseas-futures;overseas-options;futures;options;market-data;quote;tick;order-book;market-depth;kline;account;margin;open-interest;read-only;com;stdio;supervisor;reconnect;result-type;decimal;dotnet;csharp</PackageTags>

    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.TradeKit.Capital</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.TradeKit.Capital</RepositoryUrl>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>0.3.0 —Built from Capital's V2.13.59 manual, then measured against real SKCOM 2.13.59 x64 with probe-full on 2026-11-09 (a futures-only account without positions or orders) and corrected; account rows with positions, dates after midnight, the 10-code cap and overseas option ticks are still unmeasured.SKCOM version: SkcomVersion, IsTestedSkcomVersion and CapitalSkcomVersion.Tested (2.13.59_x64); an unmeasured version logs capital.skcom.version_untested and keeps running. Domestic futures and options live quotes: GetDomesticProductsAsync, SubscribeDomesticAsync (up to 10 codes) with CapitalDomesticQuote, CapitalDomesticTick, CapitalBest5 and CapitalDomesticLiveBar. Overseas best 5 and best 10: SubscribeDepthAsync with CapitalBest10. Overseas options: OverseasOptionsState, OverseasOptionsStateChanged, GetOverseasOptionProductsAsync and the subscriptions, with quote, tick, best 5 and best 10 events. Read-only futures account queries: GetAccountsAsync, GetFutureRightsAsync, GetOpenInterestAsync, GetOverseaFutureRightsAsync, GetOverseaOpenInterestAsync, GetOrderReportAsync and GetFulfillReportAsync; SKOrderLib is initialised on the first account request, report queries are spaced 5.5 s apart, records have nullable named properties and RawFields, and account numbers are masked and never logged. No order, amend, cancel or fund-transfer capability exists. Host protocol: new methods, events, status members and error codes; a 0.2.x client still works with the 0.3.0 host. Measured and corrected: zero prices in domestic quotes and ticks and overseas option quotes are null (the first quote after subscribing is partial); CapitalDomesticLiveBar.OpenTimeUtc is the end-of-minute label minus one minute; product lists use fixed positions and every domestic code has a day-only "AM" twin; overseas rights have 31 fields (IbCode, FloatingProfitLoss added); an "@@,001" overseas open-interest reply is an empty list; CapitalSkcomText detects SKOrderLib's irreversibly garbled Chinese and restores the measured fixed phrases; the same account query sent again within seconds is rejected with code 1019.0.2.0 — Domestic futures historical K-lines: CapitalHostSession.GetDomesticKLinesAsync (SKQuoteLib RequestKLineAMByDate; TX00, MTX00, TM0000; minute and daily bars; full or AM session; trading-day dates; minute open time = Taipei end time minus one minute in UTC; empty bars kept; the 60,000-row cap keeps the newest), a domestic state with DomesticStateChanged kept apart from the overseas state (an unavailable domestic side never affects overseas quotes), and the kline-tw host method with capital.kline.timeout and capital.domestic.unavailable. Fixed: an orphaned host kept running after its parent ended; the client now puts the host in a KILL_ON_JOB_CLOSE Job Object and the host also ends when its parent PID disappears, with a forced exit if an orderly shutdown hangs. Docs: the host ships self-contained, so no .NET Desktop Runtime install is needed. Known: full-session closes are settlement prices; Capital's 2026-10-30 night-session volume is doubled; overseas minute bars go back about one month and one request has a row limit (oldest rows dropped silently), so record coverage from the first bar received. 0.1.0 — First release. CapitalHostSession starts and supervises the shipped SKCOM host (credentials only through child-process environment variables, never a file or a log), reads quote and tick events into a bounded channel that drops the oldest and counts, lists overseas products, subscribes, and fetches K-lines (minute, day, week, month). A failed login is never retried; an unexpected host exit is restarted with 1, 2, 5, 10 and 30 second backoff up to MaxRestarts and the subscriptions are re-sent. Measured against SKCOM 2.13.59 on 2026-11-06: product list and details, quotes, ticks with replay, K-lines, and the FX, CME, CBOT and NYM time zones. Not measured: the 3002 reconnect, login failure codes other than by the manual, and the time zones of other exchanges (IsVerified = false). Full notes: https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.TradeKit.Capital/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md</PackageReleaseNotes>

    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>

    <!--
      Job Object 的 P/Invoke 用 LibraryImport(source-generated),產生的封送程式碼需要 unsafe。
      The Job Object P/Invokes use LibraryImport, whose generated marshalling code needs unsafe.
    -->
    <AllowUnsafeBlocks>true</AllowUnsafeBlocks>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <!-- Result / Error 幾乎每個檔案都用到,集中宣告。Result and Error are used almost everywhere, so the namespace is implicit. -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <Using Include="Ozakboy.Core.Abstractions" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <!-- 內部解析輔助型別需要直接測試,它們不屬於公開契約。Internal parsing helpers are tested directly; they are not public contract. -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="Ozakboy.TradeKit.Capital.Tests" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\..\LICENSE" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="..\..\README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="..\..\logo.png" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Update="buildTransitive\Ozakboy.TradeKit.Capital.targets" Pack="true" PackagePath="buildTransitive\Ozakboy.TradeKit.Capital.targets" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <!--
    相依政策:只允許 .NET BCL、Microsoft 官方套件與 Ozakboy.* 自研套件,判定看「遞移相依」。
    Ozakboy.Core.Abstractions(Result)與 Ozakboy.Security(遮罩 stderr 轉進來的紀錄)的型別都在公開契約上,所以明確指定;
    版本對齊 Ozakboy.TradeKit.Shioaji,同一個應用程式裡兩個券商套件不會拉出兩個版本。不引用群益的 Interop.SKCOMLib.dll。
    Dependency policy: only the .NET BCL, first-party Microsoft packages and Ozakboy.* packages, judged by the transitive
    graph. Ozakboy.Core.Abstractions (Result) and Ozakboy.Security (masking the host's stderr) are on the public contract
    and pinned directly, at the versions Ozakboy.TradeKit.Shioaji uses. Capital's Interop.SKCOMLib.dll is not referenced.
  -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Ozakboy.Core.Abstractions" Version="0.3.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="Ozakboy.Security" Version="0.1.1" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions" Version="10.0.14" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <!--
    宿主隨套件出貨:pack 時先建置宿主專案(x64、framework-dependent),把它的輸出放進 tools\capital-host\;
    使用端由 buildTransitive\Ozakboy.TradeKit.Capital.targets 在建置時複製到 $(OutDir)capital-host\。
    宿主是 net10.0-windows,本專案是 net10.0,所以不用 ProjectReference(TFM 不相容),改在 pack 時以 MSBuild 工作建置。
    The host ships inside the package: at pack time the host project (x64, framework-dependent) is built and its output
    placed in tools\capital-host\; consumers get it copied to $(OutDir)capital-host\ by the buildTransitive targets. The
    host targets net10.0-windows and this project net10.0, so a ProjectReference is not used (incompatible frameworks);
    the host is built by an MSBuild task at pack time instead.
  -->
  <PropertyGroup>
    <CapitalHostProject>$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)..\Ozakboy.TradeKit.Capital.Host\Ozakboy.TradeKit.Capital.Host.csproj</CapitalHostProject>
    <TargetsForTfmSpecificContentInPackage>$(TargetsForTfmSpecificContentInPackage);PackCapitalHost</TargetsForTfmSpecificContentInPackage>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <Target Name="PackCapitalHost">
    <!--
      這裡是本專案 TFM 專屬的內層建置,TargetFramework=net10.0 會被繼承;宿主要用自己的 net10.0-windows,所以拿掉。
      0.1.0 起宿主是 self-contained(自帶 .NET 與 Windows Desktop runtime):使用端多半是自帶 runtime 發佈的桌面程式,
      機器上不一定有共用的 Desktop Runtime,framework-dependent 的宿主會起不來。所以這裡跑 Publish,不是 Build。
      This runs in this project's TFM-specific inner build, so TargetFramework=net10.0 would be inherited; removed.
      The host is self-contained (it carries the .NET and Windows Desktop runtimes): consumers are mostly desktop apps
      published self-contained, so a shared Desktop Runtime may be missing and a framework-dependent host would not
      start. Hence Publish rather than Build.
    -->
    <PropertyGroup>
      <_CapitalHostOutputDir>$(MSBuildProjectDirectory)\$(BaseIntermediateOutputPath)capital-host-publish\$(Configuration)\</_CapitalHostOutputDir>
    </PropertyGroup>

    <RemoveDir Directories="$(_CapitalHostOutputDir)" />
    <MSBuild Projects="$(CapitalHostProject)"
             Targets="Publish"
             Properties="Configuration=$(Configuration);PublishDir=$(_CapitalHostOutputDir);RuntimeIdentifier=win-x64;SelfContained=true"
             RemoveProperties="TargetFramework;TargetFrameworks"
             BuildInParallel="false" />

    <ItemGroup>
      <_CapitalHostFile Include="$(_CapitalHostOutputDir)**\*" Exclude="$(_CapitalHostOutputDir)**\*.xml" />
      <TfmSpecificPackageFile Include="@(_CapitalHostFile)" PackagePath="tools\capital-host\%(RecursiveDir)%(Filename)%(Extension)" />
    </ItemGroup>

    <Error Condition="!Exists('$(_CapitalHostOutputDir)Ozakboy.TradeKit.Capital.Host.exe')" Text="宿主建置輸出裡找不到 Ozakboy.TradeKit.Capital.Host.exe:$(_CapitalHostOutputDir)" />
  </Target>

  <!--
    刻意不引用 Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub 套件,與其他 Ozakboy.* 套件一致。
    SourceLink is deliberately not referenced as a package, in line with the other Ozakboy.* packages.
  -->

</Project>
